NimbyShared - original work by Jeff Fabish for NIMBY | HARDCORE | BADLANDS | 1pp.
The shared client addon of the @NIMBY pack: the window shell (a UIScriptedMenu base class), a
pause-menu button registry over the vanilla DayZ 1.30 InGameMenu class (Bohemia Interactive),
the two page keys every NIMBY window reads, and the chunked RPC codec, all extracted from
NimbyGreet (plan docs/plans/2026-10-31-nimby-shared-plan.md). Will modify the vanilla
InGameMenu and MissionBase classes. No third-party mod code; no media; no string table.

Changes, newest first:

- October 31, 2026, Plan 11 Phase 1: the body. NimbySharedWindow (from NimbyGreetMenu), the
  pause-menu registry (from Greet's modded InGameMenu), NimbySharedChunks,
  NimbySharedChunkReceiver and NimbySharedChunkSender (from NimbyGreetRules, NimbyGreetFetch
  and Greet's send loop), the window, section-button and pause-button layouts (from Greet's),
  and the page keys UANimbySharedPageUp and UANimbySharedPageDown (replacing Greet's
  UANimbyGreetPageUp and UANimbyGreetPageDown, same default keys). The chunk and receiver
